+{
+  "_comment": "qwen38-flash-next adaptive speculation tiers. Hysteresis is DERIVED, not tuned: for a slot whose candidates are [.. c, next ..], the engine fires a step-up when ema_accept_len > c - 0.5 + up_hysteresis, so up_hysteresis = ema* - c + 0.5 places the step-up exactly at the tok/s break-even ema* from twox_model.py --calibrated; down_hysteresis places the step-down 0.25 ema-tokens below it, which is the hysteresis band. Break-evens used (priors A0=7.16ms U=0.8, the NVFP4 checkpoint + a 24k hot-token map, q=0.695/step): bs1 n3->n5 ema*=1.29, bs2 n3->n5 ema*=1.50. RE-DERIVE after the executor sweep lands and after the trained draft head lands.",
